    "title": "Sweet Dream - Sleep Sounds",
    "description": "Are you still troubled by insomnia? You don't have to, try Sweet Dream, let you sleep soundly.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 Realistic Mode\r\nSimulate different scenes, such as the morning by the forest, the rippling lake, the snowflakes falling in winter, the lazy afternoon, etc., we have carefully prepared beautiful pictures and suitable music for you to help you relax quickly, reduce stress and help fall asleep.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Free mode\r\nYou can freely combine different sound effects to simulate the sleeping environment you need. We provide natural sound effects, animal sound effects, musical instruments, etc., which can perfectly meet your needs.\r\n\r\nWe also provide a timer, you can set how long to stop playing music; and when you return to the desktop, the music will not be interrupted (requires some mobile phone permissions).\r\nWell, let's start your dream journey.",
